# Discord notification template.
# Uses Python str.format() syntax. Lines starting with # are stripped.
#
# Available variables:
#   {title}           - Generated title (from Gemini), or Zoom meeting topic as fallback
#   {youtube_url}     - YouTube video URL (e.g. https://youtu.be/abc123)
#   {transcript_url}  - GitHub transcript URL
#   {summary_url}     - GitHub summary URL
#   {datetime}        - Meeting date and time (e.g. 2026-03-06 13:17)
#   {cost}            - Total Gemini cost (transcription + summary)
**{title}**
🎬 {youtube_url}
📝 {transcript_url}
📋 {summary_url}
💰 {cost}
